rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/dd7e31b9a46fcf8a9ed505325e2151ec60901f4c","node_id":"C_kwDOK2CH-9oAKGRkN2UzMWI5YTQ2ZmNmOGE5ZWQ1MDUzMjVlMjE1MWVjNjA5MDFmNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/f4a63cba6cccbba402f28b20e0715feb5bd79c15","sha":"f4a63cba6cccbba402f28b20e0715feb5bd79c15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/f4a63cba6cccbba402f28b20e0715feb5bd79c15"}],"sha":"dd7e31b9a46fcf8a9ed505325e2151ec60901f4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/dd7e31b9a46fcf8a9ed505325e2151ec60901f4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/f4a63cba6cccbba402f28b20e0715feb5bd79c15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:21:12Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:21:12Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"message":"feat: 实现基于 Keep-Alive 缓存的微应用加载 UI\n\n完全重构 App.tsx，集成缓存系统：\n- 移除 React Router（不再使用路由驱动）\n- 使用 useTabs 和 useMicroAppController Hooks\n- 实现简化版 Tab 列表显示和切换\n- 添加缓存控制按钮（刷新、冻结、清空等）\n- 实时显示缓存统计信息\n\n核心功能：\n1. 应用启动按钮：\n   - 🚀 Open React App 1/2/3\n\n2. Tab 列表展示：\n   - 显示已打开的应用（带图标）\n   - 点击切换，点击 ✕ 关闭\n   - 高亮显示当前激活的 Tab\n\n3. 缓存控制：\n   - 🗑️ 清空所有缓存\n   - 🔄 刷新当前应用\n   - 🔒 冻结/🔓 解冻当前应用\n\n4. 缓存统计：\n   - 缓存数量: x / 3\n   - 冻结数量: x\n   - 当前激活: appName\n\n设计要点：\n- 自动处理错误（try-catch）\n- Tab 列表实时响应状态变化\n- 提供丰富的视觉反馈\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3de72462b0edd36a32cb1555f6ece5592e1953f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/trees/f3de72462b0edd36a32cb1555f6ece5592e1953f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/commits/f4a63cba6cccbba402f28b20e0715feb5bd79c15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/f4a63cba6cccbba402f28b20e0715feb5bd79c15","node_id":"C_kwDOK2CH-9oAKGY0YTYzY2JhNmNjY2JiYTQwMmYyOGIyMGUwNzE1ZmViNWJkNzljMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/f12b53d975cf30ee4173026f72273f835d6ce0bf","sha":"f12b53d975cf30ee4173026f72273f835d6ce0bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/f12b53d975cf30ee4173026f72273f835d6ce0bf"}],"sha":"f4a63cba6cccbba402f28b20e0715feb5bd79c15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/f4a63cba6cccbba402f28b20e0715feb5bd79c15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/f12b53d975cf30ee4173026f72273f835d6ce0bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:20:59Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:20:59Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"message":"refactor: 集成 MicroAppScope Provider 替代 qiankun 默认注册\n\n重大改动：\n- 移除 registerMicroApps 和 start（改用手动 loadMicroApp）\n- 使用 MicroAppScopeProvider 包裹整个应用\n- 配置缓存参数：maxCache=3, strategy=''lru'', enableTabPersist=true\n\n设计原因：\n- 传统 qiankun 注册方式无法实现 Keep-Alive\n- 需要手动控制微应用的加载、显示、隐藏、卸载\n- 通过 CSS display 控制显隐，而非频繁 mount/unmount\n\n迁移影响：\n- 微应用现在由用户手动触发加载（点击按钮）\n- 不再依赖路由自动加载\n- 更灵活的应用生命周期管理\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ad8e8066e2de51e9621ee71533188fcc7d2153c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/trees/ad8e8066e2de51e9621ee71533188fcc7d2153c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/commits/f12b53d975cf30ee4173026f72273f835d6ce0bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/f12b53d975cf30ee4173026f72273f835d6ce0bf","node_id":"C_kwDOK2CH-9oAKGYxMmI1M2Q5NzVjZjMwZWU0MTczMDI2ZjcyMjczZjgzNWQ2Y2UwYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/a03010e53f7caa2075c1cd5c6bf33ee67987873d","sha":"a03010e53f7caa2075c1cd5c6bf33ee67987873d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/a03010e53f7caa2075c1cd5c6bf33ee67987873d"}],"sha":"f12b53d975cf30ee4173026f72273f835d6ce0bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/f12b53d975cf30ee4173026f72273f835d6ce0bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/a03010e53f7caa2075c1cd5c6bf33ee67987873d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:20:47Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:20:47Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"message":"feat: 扩展微应用配置支持缓存和生命周期钩子\n\n为所有微应用添加缓存相关配置：\n- cacheable: 是否启用缓存（默认 true）\n- displayName: Tab 显示名称\n- icon: Tab 图标（emoji）\n- closable: Tab 是否可关闭（默认 true）\n- lifecycle: 生命周期钩子\n  * onActivate: 应用激活时触发\n  * onDeactivate: 应用失活时触发\n\n配置示例：\n- qiankun-react1: 🚀 React App 1\n- qiankun-react2: ⚡ React App 2 (带 SharedComponent)\n- qiankun-react3: 📦 React App 3 (Webpack)\n\n设计原因：\n- 提供应用级别的生命周期控制\n- 支持控制台日志输出，便于调试\n- 为未来的权限控制预留接口（closable）\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e2bcdf73cf58f6d832b804090aad6f31526895b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/trees/1e2bcdf73cf58f6d832b804090aad6f31526895b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/commits/a03010e53f7caa2075c1cd5c6bf33ee67987873d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/a03010e53f7caa2075c1cd5c6bf33ee67987873d","node_id":"C_kwDOK2CH-9oAKGEwMzAxMGU1M2Y3Y2FhMjA3NWMxY2Q1YzZiZjMzZWU2Nzk4Nzg3M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/3dd0e2c58a2c190b45ca88974d2620b868a86789","sha":"3dd0e2c58a2c190b45ca88974d2620b868a86789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/3dd0e2c58a2c190b45ca88974d2620b868a86789"}],"sha":"a03010e53f7caa2075c1cd5c6bf33ee67987873d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/a03010e53f7caa2075c1cd5c6bf33ee67987873d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/3dd0e2c58a2c190b45ca88974d2620b868a86789/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:20:31Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:20:31Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"message":"feat: 实现微应用控制 Hooks\n\n新增三个核心 Hooks：\n\n1. useMicroAppScope:\n   - 获取 MicroAppScope Context\n   - 提供 cacheManager、tabManager 等核心实例\n\n2. useMicroAppController:\n   - 提供丰富的控制 API（参考 react-activation 的 useAliveController）\n   - drop/dropAll/dropOthers: 缓存删除操作\n   - refresh: 刷新应用（卸载后重新加载）\n   - freeze/unfreeze: 冻结/解冻（防止被 LRU 淘汰）\n   - getCached/isCached: 缓存状态查询\n   - getMetrics: 获取缓存统计信息\n\n3. useTabs:\n   - 封装 Tab 管理逻辑\n   - openTab: 打开应用（自动生成 cacheKey，创建 Tab）\n   - closeTab: 关闭 Tab（删除缓存，切换到其他 Tab）\n   - switchTab: 切换到指定 Tab（从缓存恢复或重新加载）\n   - findTab: 查找 Tab\n\n设计要点：\n- 使用 useCallback 优化性能\n- 自动处理 Tab 激活/失活逻辑\n- 关闭当前 Tab 时自动激活最后一个 Tab\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a916b00475a37936b00d4480d459680e36b7d0f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/trees/a916b00475a37936b00d4480d459680e36b7d0f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/commits/3dd0e2c58a2c190b45ca88974d2620b868a86789","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/3dd0e2c58a2c190b45ca88974d2620b868a86789","node_id":"C_kwDOK2CH-9oAKDNkZDBlMmM1OGEyYzE5MGI0NWNhODg5NzRkMjYyMGI4NjhhODY3ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/eda9beddab25f86c05b4cd7ec4088d798cbb3a62","sha":"eda9beddab25f86c05b4cd7ec4088d798cbb3a62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/eda9beddab25f86c05b4cd7ec4088d798cbb3a62"}],"sha":"3dd0e2c58a2c190b45ca88974d2620b868a86789","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/3dd0e2c58a2c190b45ca88974d2620b868a86789"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/eda9beddab25f86c05b4cd7ec4088d798cbb3a62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:20:12Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:20:12Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"message":"feat: 实现 MicroAppScope Context 顶层状态管理\n\n创建 React Context 整合缓存系统：\n- MicroAppScopeProvider: 顶层 Provider 组件\n- 整合 MicroAppCacheManager 和 TabStateManager\n- 使用 useRef 避免管理器重复创建\n- 使用 useState 管理 tabs 和 activeTabKey 触发 UI 更新\n- 自动同步 TabManager 和 React 状态\n- 监听 beforeunload 事件，页面卸载前保存状态\n\n设计灵感：参考 react-activation 的 AliveScope\n\n配置参数：\n- maxCache: 最大缓存数量（默认 3）\n- strategy: 缓存策略类型（lru/lfu/fifo）\n- enableTabPersist: 是否启用 Tab 持久化\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e97d9b9b3e24d33a2f09cb0ecbc501451929050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/trees/0e97d9b9b3e24d33a2f09cb0ecbc501451929050"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/commits/eda9beddab25f86c05b4cd7ec4088d798cbb3a62","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/eda9beddab25f86c05b4cd7ec4088d798cbb3a62","node_id":"C_kwDOK2CH-9oAKGVkYTliZWRkYWIyNWY4NmMwNWI0Y2Q3ZWM0MDg4ZDc5OGNiYjNhNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/c08db9ff81c7ed71683d39f91b2f49dfb35bf444","sha":"c08db9ff81c7ed71683d39f91b2f49dfb35bf444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/c08db9ff81c7ed71683d39f91b2f49dfb35bf444"}],"sha":"eda9beddab25f86c05b4cd7ec4088d798cbb3a62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/eda9beddab25f86c05b4cd7ec4088d798cbb3a62"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/c08db9ff81c7ed71683d39f91b2f49dfb35bf444/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:19:52Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:19:52Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"message":"feat: 实现微应用缓存管理器和 Tab 持久化管理器\n\n新增两个核心管理器：\n\n1. MicroAppCacheManager:\n   - 整合 LRU 缓存策略管理微应用实例\n   - 通过 CSS display 控制显隐，避免频繁 mount/unmount\n   - 触发生命周期钩子 (onActivate/onDeactivate)\n   - 支持 drop/refresh/freeze/unfreeze 操作\n   - 延迟加载 DOM 容器元素（解决初始化顺序问题）\n\n2. TabStateManager:\n   - 使用 sessionStorage 实现 Tab 持久化\n   - 自动节流保存（300ms），优化性能\n   - 页面刷新后自动恢复 Tab 列表\n   - 页面卸载前强制保存（beforeunload 事件）\n\n设计亮点：\n- 懒加载 containerParent（getter 方式），确保 DOM 已渲染\n- LRU 淘汰时自动调用 onEvict 回调清理资源\n- 只存储 Tab 元数据，不存储应用状态\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9d425d755119c3cd70620f3792349dc648d90f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/trees/c9d425d755119c3cd70620f3792349dc648d90f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/commits/c08db9ff81c7ed71683d39f91b2f49dfb35bf444","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/c08db9ff81c7ed71683d39f91b2f49dfb35bf444","node_id":"C_kwDOK2CH-9oAKGMwOGRiOWZmODFjN2VkNzE2ODNkMzlmOTFiMmY0OWRmYjM1YmY0NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee/micro_frontends/commit/27a7a9e8b1a98ef8d1ea095b87e97e4348534732","sha":"27a7a9e8b1a98ef8d1ea095b87e97e4348534732","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/27a7a9e8b1a98ef8d1ea095b87e97e4348534732"}],"sha":"c08db9ff81c7ed71683d39f91b2f49dfb35bf444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/c08db9ff81c7ed71683d39f91b2f49dfb35bf444"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/27a7a9e8b1a98ef8d1ea095b87e97e4348534732/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:19:33Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:19:33Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"message":"feat: 添加缓存键生成和解析工具函数\n\n实现多实例微应用的缓存键管理：\n- generateCacheKey: 生成唯一缓存键（支持单实例和多实例）\n- parseCacheKey: 解析缓存键，提取 appName 和 instanceId\n- 键格式：单实例 \"qiankun-react1\"，多实例 \"qiankun-react3#user-123\"\n\n设计原因：\n- 支持同一应用的多个实例（如多个详情页）\n- 提供唯一标识用于 LRU 缓存管理\n- 便于从缓存键还原原始信息\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ba09605f5d9920b106a4abd0672c3d49b3a829e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/trees/8ba09605f5d9920b106a4abd0672c3d49b3a829e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/commits/27a7a9e8b1a98ef8d1ea095b87e97e4348534732","verification"