os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/commits/844361ae40685273d84edc97dc3439b035c4a3f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:18:54Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-13T13:18:54Z","email":"447932704@qq.com","name":"CathLee"},"message":"feat: 添加缓存策略和微应用类型定义\n\n新增 TypeScript 类型定义文件：\n- CacheStrategy 接口（支持 freeze/unfreeze 方法）\n- LRU 缓存节点数据结构 (CacheNode)\n- MicroAppConfig 扩展配置（支持生命周期钩子 onActivate/onDeactivate）\n- TabItem 和 Controller API 类型\n- 支持多实例微应用的 cacheKey 设计\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1266e5e6ca767148f91ac98f8d79b98e74668c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/trees/1266e5e6ca767148f91ac98f8d79b98e74668c4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CathLee/micro_frontends/git/commits/844361ae40685273d84edc97dc3439b035c4a3f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50312213?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CathLee","id":50312213,"login":"CathLee","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzEyMjEz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CathLee/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github