{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/0c47800df98ecc6aee8cd2dbc0b078ef6f880d6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:26:32Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:26:32Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(tests): wait for the eviction in ReplayedConnectUrlIsSingleUse\n\nThe accepted connect evicts the incumbent server-side, so the client peer\nneeds a moment to notice and swap its ConnectionState. Asserting immediately\nmade the test fail whenever the run was fast enough: 2 of 3 runs on a warm\nmachine, though a cold ~2s run always passed, which is why it read as green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0193Ra3QA1iL8skCwqKhnbrB","tree":{"sha":"49f65aa5750aab64c6179873f3a4b7ca3365f96c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/49f65aa5750aab64c6179873f3a4b7ca3365f96c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/0c47800df98ecc6aee8cd2dbc0b078ef6f880d6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/0c47800df98ecc6aee8cd2dbc0b078ef6f880d6e","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDBjNDc4MDBkZjk4ZWNjNmFlZThjZDJkYmMwYjA3OGVmNmY4ODBkNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/91dd542c764df8ffa3c9d05f4a9fd3ca219ce43b","sha":"91dd542c764df8ffa3c9d05f4a9fd3ca219ce43b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/91dd542c764df8ffa3c9d05f4a9fd3ca219ce43b"}],"sha":"0c47800df98ecc6aee8cd2dbc0b078ef6f880d6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/0c47800df98ecc6aee8cd2dbc0b078ef6f880d6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/91dd542c764df8ffa3c9d05f4a9fd3ca219ce43b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:17:07Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:17:07Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(tests): repair the -p:UseMultitargeting=true build\n\nThe test projects declare net472 through net11.0, but nothing exercised those\ntargets, so a year of new tests accumulated APIs the older ones don''t have.\nBoth test projects now compile on all ten target frameworks.\n\nWhere a target-framework-agnostic equivalent existed, the tests keep running\neverywhere: TaskCompletionSource<Unit> for the untyped TaskCompletionSource\n(net5.0+), the IHeaderDictionary indexer for .Cookie / .SetCookie\n(ASP.NET Core 6+), ByteSpanExt.ToHexString for Convert.ToHexString and\nDateTimeExt.UnixEpoch for DateTime.UnixEpoch (both net5.0+), span slices for\narray range slicing (which needs RuntimeHelpers.GetSubArray, and neither\nIndexRange nor PolySharp supplies it here), TimeSpan.FromTicks arithmetic for\nTimeSpan * number, and a qualified EntityFrameworkQueryableExtensions.CountAsync\nwhere EF Core 5 collides with System.Linq.AsyncEnumerable on DbSet<T>.\n\nConditional compilation is reserved for APIs with no equivalent: the\nRandomNumberGenerator.GetBytes(Span<byte>) override, CancellationTokenSource\n.CancelAsync, HttpRequestMessage.VersionPolicy, File.ReadAllTextAsync /\nWriteAllTextAsync, RuntimeHelpers.GetUninitializedObject, and the two allocation\nassertions built on GC.GetAllocatedBytesForCurrentThread (.NET Framework 4.8+).\nNerdbank.MessagePack is net8.0+, matching how the projects already gate it, and\nBlazorCircuitActivitySuppressorTest is off on .NET Framework, where\nActualLab.Fusion.Server.Internal doesn''t exist.\n\nTwo were plain oversights that only the excluded targets could catch:\nSystem.Net.Http is in the SDK''s implicit-usings set only from net6.0, and\nRpcWebSocketServerNetFxAuditTest never had its using ActualLab.Rpc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0193Ra3QA1iL8skCwqKhnbrB","tree":{"sha":"5bba67847c56081d55c876a669e57e607f26410e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/5bba67847c56081d55c876a669e57e607f26410e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/91dd542c764df8ffa3c9d05f4a9fd3ca219ce43b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/91dd542c764df8ffa3c9d05f4a9fd3ca219ce43b","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDkxZGQ1NDJjNzY0ZGY4ZmZhM2M5ZDA1ZjRhOWZkM2NhMjE5Y2U0M2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/841784fc84d7eae76e996310b374909dc3596d0a","sha":"841784fc84d7eae76e996310b374909dc3596d0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/841784fc84d7eae76e996310b374909dc3596d0a"}],"sha":"91dd542c764df8ffa3c9d05f4a9fd3ca219ce43b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/91dd542c764df8ffa3c9d05f4a9fd3ca219ce43b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/841784fc84d7eae76e996310b374909dc3596d0a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:49:37Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:49:37Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix: keep Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub at 8.0.0\n\n10.0.2xx+ takes a hard dependency on System.IO.Hashing, which NuGet resolves\nacross the whole graph regardless of PrivateAssets=\"all\". ActualLab.Core pins\nSystem.IO.Hashing per TFM, so -p:UseMultitargeting=true restore failed with\nNU1605 downgrade errors on net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0193Ra3QA1iL8skCwqKhnbrB","tree":{"sha":"e9d71d8335bb825d0c56894a8f1eb6485d66026f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/e9d71d8335bb825d0c56894a8f1eb6485d66026f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/841784fc84d7eae76e996310b374909dc3596d0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/841784fc84d7eae76e996310b374909dc3596d0a","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDg0MTc4NGZjODRkN2VhZTc2ZTk5NjMxMGIzNzQ5MDlkYzM1OTZkMGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/7f41ad509c705cf13f223ffd571c00a93f9d5956","sha":"7f41ad509c705cf13f223ffd571c00a93f9d5956","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/7f41ad509c705cf13f223ffd571c00a93f9d5956"}],"sha":"841784fc84d7eae76e996310b374909dc3596d0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/841784fc84d7eae76e996310b374909dc3596d0a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/7f41ad509c705cf13f223ffd571c00a93f9d5956/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:43:28Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:43:28Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"chore: update NuGet packages, migrate off XunitTestOutputLoggerProvider\n\nRoutine bumps: AwesomeAssertions 9.6.0, Meziantou.Analyzer 3.0.235,\nRoslynator.Analyzers 5.0.0, xunit.analyzers 2.0.0, Nerdbank.GitVersioning\n3.10.94, Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 10.0.401, StackExchange.Redis floor\n[3.1.31,), Aspire 13.5.3, CliWrap 3.10.5, Bullseye 6.2.0, Pastel 8.0.0,\nSystem.CommandLine 2.0.12, Npgsql.OpenTelemetry 10.0.3 (it was still on 8.0.3\nwhile Npgsql itself is [10.0.3,)), and FusionVersion 14.4.3.\n\nXunit.DependencyInjection.Logging goes to 9.0.0, which is as far as it can go:\n10.0.0+ depends on MartinCostello.Logging.XUnit.v3 and so requires xunit v3.\n9.0.0 dropped XunitTestOutputLoggerProvider, so the 9 call sites now use either\nMartinCostello.Logging.XUnit''s XUnitLoggerProvider (where the ITestOutputHelper\nis on hand) or AddXunitOutput() (where the accessor came from DI).\n\nAspire 13.5.3 warns about a missing CLI bundle (ASPIRE010). The TodoApp sample\nruns via \"dotnet run\", not \"aspire run\", so the bundle stays off.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0193Ra3QA1iL8skCwqKhnbrB","tree":{"sha":"1aae375029be7f0169ec1cb6c0c8c46ecd1b56f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/1aae375029be7f0169ec1cb6c0c8c46ecd1b56f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/7f41ad509c705cf13f223ffd571c00a93f9d5956","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/7f41ad509c705cf13f223ffd571c00a93f9d5956","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDdmNDFhZDUwOWM3MDVjZjEzZjIyM2ZmZDU3MWMwMGE5M2Y5ZDU5NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/9e76b7642f6f3e9a6d0aac286c462064db295a92","sha":"9e76b7642f6f3e9a6d0aac286c462064db295a92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/9e76b7642f6f3e9a6d0aac286c462064db295a92"}],"sha":"7f41ad509c705cf13f223ffd571c00a93f9d5956","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/7f41ad509c705cf13f223ffd571c00a93f9d5956"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/9e76b7642f6f3e9a6d0aac286c462064db295a92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:28:40Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:28:40Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(ts/rpc): gate every non-handshake write on the completed handshake\n\nRpcPeer._connection is set before the socket even opens and stays set through\nthe handshake, and RpcConnection buffers pre-OPEN sends and flushes them from\nonopen. So anything written through peer.connection during Connecting or\nHandshaking reaches the wire ahead of $sys.Handshake, and the remote rejects the\nconnection with \"Handshake failed: expected $sys.Handshake, got $sys.I\". C# is\nimmune by construction - RpcPeer.Transport (RpcPeer.cs:29-52) hides the\ntransport until the handshake completes, for exactly this reason - but the TS\nport reads the raw field, so the guarantee was lost and had already been\nre-established by hand at three separate sites.\n\nRpcPeer.wireConnection is that property''s port, and every non-handshake write\nnow goes through it: the deferred inbound $sys.Ok/$sys.Error closures (whose\nsend time is decoupled from the frame that triggered them), the keep-alive\ntimer, $sys.Cancel on abort, the four RpcStreamSender writes, RpcStream''s ack\nand ackEnd, the six system-call-handler replies, and three sites in fusion-hub -\n$sys-c.Invalidate from a setTimeout and two $sys.Cancel sends, one of them from\na FinalizationRegistry callback. A dropped reply is not lost: the inbound ones\ncome back through resendResult on $sys.Reconnect, and stream items replay from\nthe sender''s buffer on the reset ack. _sendWireData repeats the check so the\nnext caller cannot reintroduce the class.\n\n_setConnectionState only cleared _isConnected on the transition to Disconnected,\nso a server peer re-accept()ed mid-session went Connected -> Connecting ->\nHandshaking with it still set and the gate open on the un-handshaked connection.\nIt now clears on leaving Connected for any state, and the keep-alive watchdog\ndisarms there too, so the previous generation''s silence timer cannot force-close\nthe new connection mid-handshake.\n\nThree places where the port had drifted from RpcSharedStream<T> are brought back\nin line. _ended conflated \"torn down\" with \"an End was sent\" - C# tracks only\nthe former - so an End dropped while disconnected was latched and unrecoverable,\nand the consumer got $sys.Disconnect instead of a clean completion; it is now\nsplit into _isDisposed and _isCompleted, sendEnd no longer latches, and the pump\ncontinues serving acks after End (RpcSharedStream.cs:258-261) so a reset ack\nreplays it, exiting on AckEnd or teardown instead. sendEnd advances _nextIndex\nlike _batcher.Add(index++, item). And the real-time pump races the source read\nagainst the ack channel (RpcSharedStream.cs:274-279) instead of blocking, so a\nreconnect is no longer stuck behind a source that has stopped producing - a\npaused camera, a frozen screen share; the non-real-time branch still just blocks,\nwhich is deliberate backpressure in both languages. The race observes the source\npromise without consuming it, so a throwing source still becomes $sys.End(error)\nthrough bufferNext''s catch rather than rejecting the pump.\n\nThis survived because connectWith, the test-only \"synthesize connected\"\nshortcut, never sent a handshake, so every server peer in the suite sat in\nHandshaking with the gate permanently open. It now exchanges the real frame, in\nthe run loop''s order (handshake first, then Connected releases deferred calls),\nand for a same-peer reconnect waits for the reply before reconciling - racing it\nagainst conn.closed, as the run loop does - because _reconcileReconnect sends\n_remoteHandshakeIndex and a stale one draws TooLateToReconnect, silently\ndowngrading four same-peer tests to blind resend. RpcClientPeer records that\nindex wherever a handshake is observed, not only on the run loop''s path.\n\nwhenSent''s semantics follow from the pump outliving its source: it resolves on\nAckEnd or disconnect, not when the source drains, and a source error arrives as\n$sys.End(error) rather than rejecting it. Docstring updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01V3V3ZnW46TrKvKqfRn1tSL","tree":{"sha":"41e22d4479ef37c55aaaa0dd3924ef74f251f0b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/41e22d4479ef37c55aaaa0dd3924ef74f251f0b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/9e76b7642f6f3e9a6d0aac286c462064db295a92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/9e76b7642f6f3e9a6d0aac286c462064db295a92","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDllNzZiNzY0MmY2ZjNlOWE2ZDBhYWMyODZjNDYyMDY0ZGIyOTVhOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/4420dbb5e678a9a5b6553d26e2b15d34034b402c","sha":"4420dbb5e678a9a5b6553d26e2b15d34034b402c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/4420dbb5e678a9a5b6553d26e2b15d34034b402c"}],"sha":"9e76b7642f6f3e9a6d0aac286c462064db295a92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/9e76b7642f6f3e9a6d0aac286c462064db295a92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/4420dbb5e678a9a5b6553d26e2b15d34034b402c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:08:44Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T07:08:44Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"chore: upgrade .NET 11 to rc.1\n\nSDK 11.0.100-rc.1.26425.128 and DotNet11Version [11.0.0-rc.1.26425.128,),\nwhich drives ASP.NET Core, Blazor, Microsoft.Extensions.* and the System.*\npackages that track it on net11.0.\n\nEntityFrameworkCoreVersion11 stays at preview.6: efcore.pg''s newest .NET 11\npreview exact-pins EF Core to that build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0193Ra3QA1iL8skCwqKhnbrB","tree":{"sha":"855def6344805cd7d6a7b99e6750ded31887d36f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/855def6344805cd7d6a7b99e6750ded31887d36f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/4420dbb5e678a9a5b6553d26e2b15d34034b402c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/4420dbb5e678a9a5b6553d26e2b15d34034b402c","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDQ0MjBkYmI1ZTY3OGE5YTViNjU1M2QyNmUyYjE1ZDM0MDM0YjQwMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/a5233798ea72425ad82621cd6bc930e0997250c1","sha":"a5233798ea72425ad82621cd6bc930e0997250c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/a5233798ea72425ad82621cd6bc930e0997250c1"}],"sha":"4420dbb5e678a9a5b6553d26e2b15d34034b402c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/4420dbb5e678a9a5b6553d26e2b15d34034b402c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/a5233798ea72425ad82621cd6bc930e0997250c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:08:16Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:08:16Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"docs: changelog entry for v14.4.3 (NuGet + npm)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"986684ede44f82fcacd42cecfe152091e9630420","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/986684ede44f82fcacd42cecfe152091e9630420"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/a5233798ea72425ad82621cd6bc930e0997250c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/a5233798ea72425ad82621cd6bc930e0997250c1","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKGE1MjMzNzk4ZWE3MjQyNWFkODI2MjFjZDZiYzkzMGUwOTk3MjUwYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/eec6e307655823a825bd49f9125767fe80039290","sha":"eec6e307655823a825bd49f9125767fe80039290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/eec6e307655823a825bd49f9125767fe80039290"}],"sha":"a5233798ea72425ad82621cd6bc930e0997250c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/a5233798ea72425ad82621cd6bc930e0997250c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/eec6e307655823a825bd49f9125767fe80039290/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:34:26Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(ts/rpc): stamp the outage on the other path that clears _isConnected\n\nconn.closed flips _isConnected directly - deliberately, since the connection can\ndie while the state machine is still Connecting or Handshaking - and the\n_setConnectionState call after it early-returns when the state is already\nDisconnected. So _disconnectedAt stayed 0 there and the connect deadline ran\nfrom the call rather than from the outage, giving a call already in flight less\nthan its full timeout.\n\nNo production path reached it (connectWith has no callers outside tests), but it\nwas the path the new test used, so the \"measured from the disconnect\" semantics\nwere untested. The test now starts the call 150ms before the disconnect and\nasserts the rejection lands no sooner than the timeout after it; without the\nstamp it fires at 222ms and the test fails.\n\nAlso: the maintenance docstring still described the old rule, the IsLongLiving\nnote claimed a timeout exemption it never was (it governs when the cancellation\nhandler is released) and said TS has no RpcStream, connectTimeoutMs''s doc\npredated the sent-call rule, and the tracker header''s .NET inventory omitted\nHandleDisconnect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"587a29c5257fbed80217cf744b64a7523e505ddb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/587a29c5257fbed80217cf744b64a7523e505ddb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/eec6e307655823a825bd49f9125767fe80039290","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/eec6e307655823a825bd49f9125767fe80039290","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKGVlYzZlMzA3NjU1ODIzYTgyNWJkNDlmOTEyNTc2N2ZlODAwMzkyOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/c437a330aaea2ac3a494894053230652a506a8ab","sha":"c437a330aaea2ac3a494894053230652a506a8ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/c437a330aaea2ac3a494894053230652a506a8ab"}],"sha":"eec6e307655823a825bd49f9125767fe80039290","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/eec6e307655823a825bd49f9125767fe80039290"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/c437a330aaea2ac3a494894053230652a506a8ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:24:27Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(ts/rpc): ConnectTimeout must cap a sent call waiting out a disconnect\n\nThe maintenance loop applied connectTimeoutMs only to unsent calls, and run\ntimeouts only while connected - so a call that was already sent when the link\ndropped was capped by neither and waited indefinitely for reconnect and replay.\nThat was the .NET behaviour before this branch; .NET now applies ConnectTimeout\nto every registered incomplete call during an outage, sent or not, measured from\nthe later of the disconnect and the call. The peer tracks _disconnectedAt for it.\n\nAlso corrects three comments that no longer described either side: both files\nclaimed TS has no per-call timeout mechanism (it does - _maintainOutboundCalls),\nand the tracker attributed .NET''s multi-pass Abort to catching late-registered\ncalls, which is now done by a final-error latch instead. Pinned .NET line\nnumbers replaced with names, since this branch moved most of them.\n\nVerified by mutation: with the sent-call branch removed the new test times out.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"74af15c10119c7998e34a805051f5cb567720bff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/74af15c10119c7998e34a805051f5cb567720bff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/c437a330aaea2ac3a494894053230652a506a8ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https