 previous commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"703d33e67db5542769be218c0eb4a006236593ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/703d33e67db5542769be218c0eb4a006236593ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/d7a8587cdb8c5c8991c845127ed4d58131223e24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/d7a8587cdb8c5c8991c845127ed4d58131223e24","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKGQ3YTg1ODdjZGI4YzVjODk5MWM4NDUxMjdlZDRkNTgxMzEyMjNlMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/6c9fee97497882e08392e49f687ad62c0bb0dfcc","sha":"6c9fee97497882e08392e49f687ad62c0bb0dfcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/6c9fee97497882e08392e49f687ad62c0bb0dfcc"}],"sha":"d7a8587cdb8c5c8991c845127ed4d58131223e24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/d7a8587cdb8c5c8991c845127ed4d58131223e24"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/6c9fee97497882e08392e49f687ad62c0bb0dfcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:10:19Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"docs(plans): mark the offline-fallback plan superseded\n\nPart 1 (ReturnDefault) shipped as written; part 2 did not - CacheFallbackDelay\ndelivered by the peer-level watcher replaced the ReconnectTimeout it proposed.\nKept as a dated record per the convention in proxy-method-slots.md, since its\nconsumer rationale lives nowhere else.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"f7e04804e3fb833c3ca27abe85f32985901a96db","url":"https://ap