exyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/91a84222a5f6e06af688f7746ae8c002aed9a6d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:09:35Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(fusion): report the peer''s terminal error from RpcPeerStateMonitor\n\nA peer that stops before the monitor''s loop reads its state cancels\npeerCancellationToken, and the OperationCanceledException that comes out was\npublished as LastError - so the error the peer actually recorded never reached\ncallers, and the monitor spun republishing a meaningless one.\n\nThe old Abort ran 3 cycles of CallAbortCyclePeriod inside Reset, which delayed\npeer shutdown by ~3s and hid this; making Abort a single sweep exposed it.\nUnsupportedFormatTest_PeerStateMonitor covers it (both HTTP and WebSocket) and\nnow passes in 0.2s rather than waiting that delay out.\n\nDocs: drop the CallAbortCyclePeriod row and its orphaned source comment, add\nDisconnectCheckPeriod, add RpcTimeoutException to the short index, and document\nComputedRenderStateComponent.StateEqualityComparer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"aa5f9d8fb738325e1d2f2716c463145634387ff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/aa5f9d8fb738325e1d2f2716c463145634387ff4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/91a84222a5f6e06af688f7746ae8c002aed9a6d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/91a84222a5f6e06af688f7746ae8c002aed9a6d9","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDkxYTg0MjIyYTVmNmUwNmFmNjg4Zjc3NDZhZThjMDAyYWVkOWE2ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/f00905338aa110cd57fd45ce8d599c0cb24abb5b","sha":"f00905338aa110cd57fd45ce8d599c0cb24abb5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/f00905338aa110cd57fd45ce8d599c0cb24abb5b"}],"sha":"91a84222a5f6e06af688f7746ae8c002aed9a6d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/91a84222a5f6e06af688f7746ae8c002aed9a6d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/f00905338aa110cd57fd45ce8d599c0cb24abb5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:42:46Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"test(rpc,fusion): cover the own-hub guard and the server-peer outage scan\n\nThe own-hub guard had no tests at all, before or after the branch. Client and\nserver share one hub in the test harness, so IsOwnHub is true on every test\nconnection - which is what makes these cheap to write. Three tests: a compute\ncall that must not reach its own hub fails instead of being sent, the same on\nthe resend path (which the deleted per-handshake sweep used to cover), and a\nplain call is still not blocked.\n\nA server peer has no ReconnectsAt, so the watcher''s \"did the reconnect move?\"\ntrigger is always false for it; without the explicit first pass nothing would\never scan its calls. The new test drives HandleDisconnect directly.\n\nMutation-verified: dropping either own-hub check fails exactly one test,\nand removing the first-pass trigger fails the server-peer one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"ee8c94ba84730746dbe80ced0e1b490ed464b338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/ee8c94ba84730746dbe80ced0e1b490ed464b338"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/f00905338aa110cd57fd45ce8d599c0cb24abb5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/f00905338aa110cd57fd45ce8d599c0cb24abb5b","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKGYwMDkwNTMzOGFhMTEwY2Q1N2ZkNDVjZThkNTk5YzBjYjI0YWJiNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/51bf17d99c2ed691a816ebb3d3749cc594a281d6","sha":"51bf17d99c2ed691a816ebb3d3749cc594a281d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/51bf17d99c2ed691a816ebb3d3749cc594a281d6"}],"sha":"f00905338aa110cd57fd45ce8d599c0cb24abb5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/f00905338aa110cd57fd45ce8d599c0cb24abb5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/51bf17d99c2ed691a816ebb3d3749cc594a281d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:38:59Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"test(fusion): cover a cold cache miss that fails before the call is sent\n\nCache mode with a finite ConnectTimeout registers a call whose cache capture\nnever gets a Call, because the watcher fails it before it is ever sent. Reading\nthe capture then has to cope with that rather than locking on the missing Call.\n\nEvery existing connect-timeout test used NoCache, where the capture is null and\nthe earlier return hides this path, so nothing covered it. Verified by mutation:\nrestoring the unguarded lock makes the test fail with NullReferenceException\ninstead of RpcTimeoutException - the exact defect it is there to catch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"e31f328db937907b6483e1aff4a7d391f57161b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/e31f328db937907b6483e1aff4a7d391f57161b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/51bf17d99c2ed691a816ebb3d3749cc594a281d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/51bf17d99c2ed691a816ebb3d3749cc594a281d6","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDUxYmYxN2Q5OWMyZWQ2OTFhODE2ZWJiM2QzNzQ5Y2M1OTRhMjgxZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/958a4f58fc8fad9a9031b0f68790fb6c0ff92ff4","sha":"958a4f58fc8fad9a9031b0f68790fb6c0ff92ff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/958a4f58fc8fad9a9031b0f68790fb6c0ff92ff4"}],"sha":"51bf17d99c2ed691a816ebb3d3749cc594a281d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/51bf17d99c2ed691a816ebb3d3749cc594a281d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/958a4f58fc8fad9a9031b0f68790fb6c0ff92ff4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:36:35Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"test(rpc): cover what a call registered on a finished peer gets\n\nSix tests over the _finalError latch: a call registered after a reroute or an\nabort completes instead of staying pending, a reroute supersedes a terminal\nerror latched earlier, the latched call is neither sent nor left holding a\ncancellation registration, and a call registered before the latch is still\nswept.\n\nVerified by mutation rather than by passing: removing the latch fails 5 of the\n6, sending unconditionally from Invoke fails 1, installing the handler\nunconditionally fails 2, and dropping the reroute-supersedes rule fails 1.\nThe send test needs a connected peer - with no transport nothing is sent\neither way, so an unstarted peer cannot tell the two apart.\n\nEvery await is bounded: a regression here means \"never completes\", which\nshould fail fast rather than hang to the xUnit timeout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"40499b1b82b6d09d81a58cdea31ee9c420dc4392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/40499b1b82b6d09d81a58cdea31ee9c420dc4392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/958a4f58fc8fad9a9031b0f68790fb6c0ff92ff4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/958a4f58fc8fad9a9031b0f68790fb6c0ff92ff4","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDk1OGE0ZjU4ZmM4ZmFkOWE5MDMxYjBmNjg3OTBmYjZjMGZmOTJmZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/67317f281d2bccedaab3dcbce721927944eb6d51","sha":"67317f281d2bccedaab3dcbce721927944eb6d51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/67317f281d2bccedaab3dcbce721927944eb6d51"}],"sha":"958a4f58fc8fad9a9031b0f68790fb6c0ff92ff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/958a4f58fc8fad9a9031b0f68790fb6c0ff92ff4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/67317f281d2bccedaab3dcbce721927944eb6d51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:17:15Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"feat(MeshRpc): count Fusion Get calls separately when the caller caches\n\nA Fusion Get runs ComputeCachedOrRpc on a host with a RemoteComputedCache and\nComputeRpc without one. Those are the two paths the serve-stale logic differs\non, so lumping them into one row hid which of them a warn or failure came from.\nCommands stay merged - they aren''t cached, so the host''s cache doesn''t split them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"fca510b391b4bfe6b3fe366fc1ab88a10f3486bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/fca510b391b4bfe6b3fe366fc1ab88a10f3486bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/67317f281d2bccedaab3dcbce721927944eb6d51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/67317f281d2bccedaab3dcbce721927944eb6d51","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDY3MzE3ZjI4MWQyYmNjZWRhYWIzZGNiY2U3MjE5Mjc5NDRlYjZkNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/d690cc1287c319930bba95a05af9c77b6775d297","sha":"d690cc1287c319930bba95a05af9c77b6775d297","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/d690cc1287c319930bba95a05af9c77b6775d297"}],"sha":"67317f281d2bccedaab3dcbce721927944eb6d51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/67317f281d2bccedaab3dcbce721927944eb6d51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/d690cc1287c319930bba95a05af9c77b6775d297/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:12:50Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"feat(MeshRpc): count calls per kind, print only warned and failed ones\n\nA healthy run printed two lines per call, which buried the interesting ones.\nTestStats now counts every call per kind as ok/warn/failed/error, Program.cs\ndumps the table every StatsPeriod (5s), and only warned and failed calls still\nlog at the moment they happen.\n\nAn exception is now counted and logged per call instead of ending the worker\nthat hit it, so one failure no longer removes a worker from the stats.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"c62d924fcc0ecf46b118c0a092b6a75a0eed091a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/c62d924fcc0ecf46b118c0a092b6a75a0eed091a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/d690cc1287c319930bba95a05af9c77b6775d297","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/d690cc1287c319930bba95a05af9c77b6775d297","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKGQ2OTBjYzEyODdjMzE5OTMwYmJhOTVhMDVhZjljNzdiNjc3NWQyOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/113ff3ec8e19fd6fff3d61d3d1cdd460f7ae05b9","sha":"113ff3ec8e19fd6fff3d61d3d1cdd460f7ae05b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/113ff3ec8e19fd6fff3d61d3d1cdd460f7ae05b9"}],"sha":"d690cc1287c319930bba95a05af9c77b6775d297","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/d690cc1287c319930bba95a05af9c77b6775d297"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/113ff3ec8e19fd6fff3d61d3d1cdd460f7ae05b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T11:04:33Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(MeshRpc): give outbound calls a 1s CacheFallbackDelay\n\nThe framework default is zero - serve the cached value the moment the peer\ndrops - which in a mesh that reshards every few seconds lets a client answer\nfrom cache while rerouting is still in flight. TestRunner''s staleness check\nthen reports a correct-but-old value as a failure.\n\nRerouting should always beat 1s here, so a served cached value now means\nrerouting was too slow, which is what that check is for.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"6f16c496bf5ef715e3ccba485f91c2fed7f88621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/6f16c496bf5ef715e3ccba485f91c2fed7f88621"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/113ff3ec8e19fd6fff3d61d3d1cdd460f7ae05b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/113ff3ec8e19fd6fff3d61d3d1cdd460f7ae05b9","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDExM2ZmM2VjOGUxOWZkNmZmZjNkNjFkM2QxY2RkNDYwZjdhZTA1Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/6c1e042a45c20975a4197c95af63c1b712a0c1c4","sha":"6c1e042a45c20975a4197c95af63c1b712a0c1c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/6c1e042a45c20975a4197c95af63c1b712a0c1c4"}],"sha":"113ff3ec8e19fd6fff3d61d3d1cdd460f7ae05b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/113ff3ec8e19fd6fff3d61d3d1cdd460f7ae05b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/6c1e042a45c20975a4197c95af63c1b712a0c1c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:53:45Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T12:42:09Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(rpc): complete every registered call; cover resends with the own-hub check\n\nRegister now reports whether the call stayed pending, so a call arriving after\nthe final-error latch is neither sent nor left holding a cancellation\nregistration nothing would ever unregister.\n\nA reroute supersedes a terminal error latched earlier: running on the new\ntarget beats failing, and a route that changes after the stop would otherwise\nhand late calls RpcReconnectFailedException.\n\nThe own-hub check moves into TryFailOnOwnHub and is called from SendRegistered\ntoo, so resends are covered - a reconnect through a load balancer can land on\nour own hub even when the first send didn''t. That gap arrived when the\nper-handshake AbortOwnHubCalls sweep was removed.\n\nAlso: drop RpcLimits.CallAbortCyclePeriod (unread since Abort stopped looping),\ncorrect the RunTimeout doc (the clock restarts on resend, not on a queued call\nfinally being sent), fix PartB.md''s MustRenderAfterEvent default and the\nIsRenderStateChanged row, and drop the StaleValueListener copy in\nFusionRpcServeStaleTest for the shared one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018Y92apva7VPeum3AxzAsBV","tree":{"sha":"322454d9693b46c66c2ef36980923aa7936f9911","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/322454d9693b46c66c2ef36980923aa7936f9911"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/6c1e042a45c20975a4197c95af63c1b712a0c1c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"http