:{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:25:53Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:25:53Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"docs: changelog entry for v14.3.40 (NuGet-only, npm stays at 14.3.34)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N4Tgs7oiMto1Q3snuXfjCr","tree":{"sha":"ae678e2d1e1a1b7e615c8816acb2bd8980f07919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/ae678e2d1e1a1b7e615c8816acb2bd8980f07919"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/70f496d0349ec571aa457c493359230b94c83adc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/70f496d0349ec571aa457c493359230b94c83adc","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDcwZjQ5NmQwMzQ5ZWM1NzFhYTQ1N2M0OTMzNTkyMzBiOTRjODNhZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/2dc3129be7c586e9431e91729c3c92acc2636418","sha":"2dc3129be7c586e9431e91729c3c92acc2636418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/2dc3129be7c586e9431e91729c3c92acc2636418"}],"sha":"70f496d0349ec571aa457c493359230b94c83adc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/70f496d0349ec571aa457c493359230b94c83adc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/2dc3129be7c586e9431e91729c3c92acc2636418/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:06:24Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:06:24Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(core): every hand-written MessagePack formatter reads nil as default\n\n14.3.38 made ApiArray<T> read nil as Empty; the same slot-predates-the-property\ncase hits every other custom formatter whose deserializer starts with\nReadArrayHeader() or ReadInt64(). Option<T>, ApiOption<T>, Result<T>, Moment\nand CpuTimestamp now return default on nil in both the MessagePack-CSharp\nformatters and the Nerdbank converters; PropertyBag<T>, PropertyBagItem<T> and\nTypeDecoratingUniSerialized<,> drop their explicit \"Unexpected nil\" throw for\nthe same; and the Nerdbank-only RpcObjectId, RpcHeader, RpcHeaderKey and\nRpcMethodRef converters get the same guard. Serialization is untouched.\n\nMessagePackNilTest reads a lone nil through both serializers for every\nhand-written type and replaces the ApiArray-only test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N4Tgs7oiMto1Q3snuXfjCr","tree":{"sha":"6b8f07063884c7351af3a543fc1f7b135064c3ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/6b8f07063884c7351af3a543fc1f7b135064c3ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/2dc3129be7c586e9431e91729c3c92acc2636418","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/2dc3129be7c586e9431e91729c3c92acc2636418","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDJkYzMxMjliZTdjNTg2ZTk0MzFlOTE3MjljM2M5MmFjYzI2MzY0MTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/070f6e545a997db2c3095e485e2b7b005acd95f6","sha":"070f6e545a997db2c3095e485e2b7b005acd95f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/070f6e545a997db2c3095e485e2b7b005acd95f6"}],"sha":"2dc3129be7c586e9431e91729c3c92acc2636418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/2dc3129be7c586e9431e91729c3c92acc2636418"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/070f6e545a997db2c3095e485e2b7b005acd95f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T15:38:12Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T15:38:12Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"docs: changelog entry for v14.3.38 (NuGet-only, npm stays at 14.3.34)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01N4Tgs7oiMto1Q3snuXfjCr","tree":{"sha":"c99a3b5ec05720e1fd2453b25fac140953c42b8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/c99a3b5ec05720e1fd2453b25fac140953c42b8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/070f6e545a997db2c3095e485e2b7b005acd95f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/070f6e545a997db2c3095e485e2b7b005acd95f6","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDA3MGY2ZTU0NWE5OTdkYjJjMzA5NWU0ODVlMmI3YjAwNWFjZDk1ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/7777cee664d614b871e5a4e111c3ffc18d34eb73","sha":"7777cee664d614b871e5a4e111c3ffc18d34eb73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/7777cee664d614b871e5a4e111c3ffc18d34eb73"}],"sha":"070f6e545a997db2c3095e485e2b7b005acd95f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/070f6e545a997db2c3095e485e2b7b005acd95f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/7777cee664d614b871e5a4e111c3ffc18d34eb73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T15:30:40Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T15:30:40Z","email":"alex.yakunin@gmail.com","name":"Alex Yakunin"},"message":"fix(core): ApiArray MessagePack deserializers read nil as Empty\n\nAn ApiArray<T> property added to an array-form MessagePackObject reads as nil\nfrom blobs written before the property existed. Both the MessagePack-CSharp\nformatter and the Nerdbank converter called ReadArrayHeader() on that nil and\nthrew \"Unexpected msgpack code 192 (nil) encountered\", which made every such\npersisted blob unreadable. Nil now deserializes as ApiArray<T>.Empty; the\nserializers still write an empty array header, so older readers are unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017YUMeDcp1HKR8iuEy6GF4D","tree":{"sha":"3aeadca14473e73f515e45ce51eeb80847caa8e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/trees/3aeadca14473e73f515e45ce51eeb80847caa8e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/git/commits/7777cee664d614b871e5a4e111c3ffc18d34eb73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1673423?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/alexyakunin","id":1673423,"login":"alexyakunin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzM0MjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexyakunin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/7777cee664d614b871e5a4e111c3ffc18d34eb73","node_id":"C_kwDOK56hNtoAKDc3NzdjZWU2NjRkNjE0Yjg3MWU1YTRlMTExYzNmZmMxOGQzNGViNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ActualLab/Fusion/commit/2aa76ab3db3a913f78f1183e9477c1648ae83878","sha":"2aa76ab3db3a913f78f1183e9477c1648ae83878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLab/Fusion/commits/2aa76ab3db3a913f78f1183e9477c1648ae83878"}],"sha":"7777cee664d614b871e5a4e111c3ffc18d34eb73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ActualLa