ore for clarity; add .golangci.yml for linting configuration; modify README for updates\n\n* Update Dockerfile and Makefile for version upgrades and structure improvements\n\n* Add main application entry point with Kubernetes controller setup\n\n* Implement code changes to enhance functionality and improve performance\n\n* Update copyright year to 2025 in API schema files\n\n* Fix: Correct builder name in docker buildx command in Makefile\n\n* Update copyright year to 2025 in boilerplate file\n\n* Moved stuff to internal\n\n* Adapt test further to use repositories and add reconcile tests\n\n* Refactor import paths to use internal packages for consistency\n\n* Update copyright year to 2025 and upgrade controller-gen version in CRD files\n\n* Update copyright year to 2025 in multiple files\n\n* Refactor code structure for improved readability and maintainability\n\n* Refactor Polyfea API generated files for consistency and readability\n\n- Updated comments in multiple files to ensure consistent formatting and clarity.\n- Removed unnecessary whitespace and added missing newlines at the end of files.\n- Adjusted interface definitions and struct fields for improved alignment.\n- Enhanced code readability by standardizing spacing around type definitions and function signatures.\n- Ensured all comments accurately describe the functionality and purpose of the code.\n\n* Refactor code structure for improved readability and maintainability\n\n* Enhance metrics and webhook server configuration with TLS options and certificate watchers\n\n* Refactor middleware unit tests for improved structure and clarity\n\n* Refactor dependencies and update regex usage for improved clarity and performance\n\n* Refactor logging from zerolog to logr in Polyfea API service and related components\n\n* Refactor MicroFrontend controller tests to improve reconciliation logic and structure\n\n* Refactor MicroFrontend and WebComponent controllers to use updated API types and improve test structure\n\n