.github.com/users/Kemi-Oluwadahunsi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kemi-Oluwadahunsi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kemi-Oluwadahunsi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kemi-Oluwadahunsi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kemi-Oluwadahunsi/My-Portfolio-React/commits/b0bfc8282706778340941592f55f179b4cf2a4b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-30T13:49:11Z","email":"kemilat50@gmail.com","name":"Kemi-Oluwadahunsi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-30T13:49:11Z","email":"kemilat50@gmail.com","name":"Kemi-Oluwadahunsi"},"message":"feat: convert portfolio to Progressive Web App (PWA)\n\n- Enhanced PWA manifest with complete configuration (icons, theme, display mode)\n- Added comprehensive service worker with multiple caching strategies\n  - CacheFirst for fonts and static assets\n  - StaleWhileRevalidate for JS/CSS\n  - NetworkFirst for API calls\n- Created PWAUpdate component with:\n  - Update notifications when new versions available\n  - Install prompt for users\n  - Offline detection and status indicator\n- Added PWA meta tags to index.html (Apple touch icons, theme colors)\n- Removed unused dependencies (13 packages):\n  - @react-hook/media-query, @react-spring/web, loaders.css\n  - lottie-react, react-hook-form, react-loaders\n  - react-slick, slick-carousel, zod, zustand, tsc, vitest\n  - @vitejs/plugin-react (using react-swc instead)\n- Fixed vite.config.js to remove @react-spring/web from manualChunks\n- Fixed PWAUpdate SCSS import issue\n- Portfolio now installable, works offline, and auto-updates","tree":{"sha":"47dc18e638a2c8ca6d9cf1745be65a4578dcde24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kemi-Oluwadahunsi/My-Portfolio-React/git/trees/47dc18e638a2c8ca6d9cf1745be65a4578dcde24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kemi-Oluwadahunsi/My-Portfolio-React/git/commits/b0bfc8282706778340941592f55f17