tor (src-admin/src/components/PagePowerEditor.tsx):\n- 3x3 grid mirroring the NSPanel layout: left column 3 slots, center\n  column homeTop / home-icon / homeBot, right column 3 slots\n- Click on any slot opens a modal with all fields (icon, state via\n  EntitySelector, decimal/unit selects, optional color scale with\n  min/max/best, speed scale with min/max + reverse, headline,\n  iconColor)\n- Home-bot dialog toggles between a state and an internal sum, with\n  multi-select of slots that contribute negatively to the sum\n\nManager + filter:\n- PageConfigManager: handleAdd default + renderMiddlePanel dispatch\n- PageConfigLayout: cardPower added to PageCardType + filter Select\n\nAdapter pipeline (src/lib/configuration/admin.ts):\n- New case ''cardPower'' with helper dataForCardPower(entry, adapter)\n- buildPowerSlotData() builds the cardPowerDataItemOptions.data sub-\n  structure (icon with triGrad scale, value, speed with negate, text,\n  targetUnit) mirroring PagePower.getPowerPageConfig output\n- Side-effect: synthesises a flat power${i}_* record in\n  adapter.config.pagePowerdata so PagePower.update() and onInternal-\n  Command can still read pagePowerdata[index] at runtime. Replaces an\n  existing record with the same pageName so React wins on conflict.\n\ni18n: added page_type_power and the power_* editor keys to en/de\ntranslations.json (other languages fall back to English keys).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix powerpage\n\n* update build\n\n* tom ist es schuld\n\n* 2.try noch nicht gut\n\n* add themeName IconSelect\nfix  color for icon and text\n\n* pageTrashEditor\n- change class to ConfigGeneric\n- fix themeName IconSelect\n- fix InputProps\n\n* add komplett\n\n* debug\n\n* toms forderungen\n\n* Warum es nicht ging: In PagePowerEditor.onDragStart fehlte der Aufruf e.dataTransfer.setData(...). Firefox und Safari starten ohne setData keinen echten Drag\n  — das mousedown → mouseup wurde dann als Klick interpretiert und öffnete stattdessen den Edit-Dialog. PageMenuEditor macht es richtig\n  (PageMenuEditor.tsx:566).\n\n  Was geändert wurde (src-admin/src/components/PagePowerEditor.tsx):\n  - dataTransfer.setData(''text/plain'', slot) in onDragStart ergänzt\n  - Drag-Quelle zusätzlich in einer Instanzvariable dragSourceSlot gespeichert (synchroner Zugriff im onDrop ohne setState-Race, gleiches Muster wie\n  dragSourceIndex in PageMenuEditor)\n  - e.stopPropagation() im onDrop (verhindert Bubble-Klick)\n  - README-Changelog-Eintrag unter ### **WORK IN PROGRESS**\n\n* fix color trashIcon\n\n* AdminUI QREditor\n- Change GenericConfig\n\n* update bug bericht\n\n* claude session\n\n* update claude findings\n\n* findings\n\n* doc: nextion-flash autoexec_v11 + Live-Verifikation\n\nv11-Patches gegen die in doc/diagnose_2026-05-03_final.md analysierten\nHänger eingebaut: Cleanup ==/>=, TIMEOUT 30s->60s + Sub-Block-Guard,\nHeader-Read-Loop in open_url_at, Hard-Aborts bei nil/0-flash_size,\nPatch 8 (5-Byte Combined Offset Frame), try/except mit Recovery,\nDriver-Version 10 -> 11.\n\nLive-Lauf 2026-05-04: kompletter Flash von nspanel-v5.1.1.tft (12 227 824 B)\nin 97 s, finale 1264-B-Restschreibung sauber, MQTT\n{\"complete\":\"done\",\"time_elapsed\":97}. Diagnose-Logs nach Verifikation\nauskommentiert (write_block ENTER/EXIT Sample, Wait-for-available,\nHeader-Bytes-Trace, Content-Length-Parse-Trace) — Setup-, Progress- und\nFehler-Logs bleiben aktiv. Bericht in doc/v11_deploy_report_2026-05-04.md,\nLive-Log in doc/tasmota_flash_v11_20260504_082607.log.\n\nv11 ist experimentell unter doc/ — für Adapter-Promotion müsste sie\nnach tasmota/berry/11/autoexec.be umziehen und die Adapter-Konfig auf\nversion=11 wechseln.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix disabled carGrid2\n\n* change pageMenueEditor to ConfigGeneric\n\n* fix internalsuply\n\n* fix lint\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ticaki <ticaki@renopoint.de>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 